+name: Widescreen
+description: 16:9 view for stages and cutscenes (the bars of the cutscenes go). Set the aspect ratio to 16:9 or Stretch in the game's settings.
+
+# Byte patterns, not addresses: "find <bytes> -> <bytes>" searches the XBE for
+# the first bytes and writes the second ones there (every match, up to 64).
+# A pattern that isn't found (another release of the game) is skipped and
+# logged. From a widescreen patch list for Otogi: Myth of Demons (46530002).
+[default.xbe]
+# value 1
+find DB442468 85C97D06 D805BC44 1700DEF9 8B151868 -> DB442468 90909090 D80D7444 1700DEF9 8B151868
+# value 2
+find DB442454 85C97D06 D805BC44 1700DEF9 8B151868 -> DB442454 90909090 D80D7444 1700DEF9 8B151868
+# render fix
+find 85C07D06 D805BC44 1700DEF9 518B0D18 -> 90909090 D8357444 1700DEF9 518B0D18
+# cutscenes letterbox fix
+find 2C3E0000 00C74424 10000000 00C74424 14A20100 -> 2C000000 00C74424 10000000 00C74424 14E00100
